## Required

- ALWAYS USE SIMPLE, CLEAR, AND EXTREMELY CONCISE LANGUAGE.
- ALWAYS Keep it Simple (KISS).
- ALWAYS Continue when the next step is clear.
- ALWAYS Follow existing repo conventions and patterns.

## Prohibited

- NEVER use verbose, repetitive, or padded language.
- NEVER explain obvious steps or add unnecessary background.
- NEVER ask avoidable questions when you can proceed safely.
- NEVER make unrelated edits or add unrequested improvements.
